#. Enable firewall service checkbox
#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/proposal.rb:76
msgid "Enable Firewall"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ໄຟວໍ"

#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/proposal.rb:96
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Firewall and SSH</big></b><br>\n"
"Firewall is a defensive mechanism that protects your computer from network "
"attacks.\n"
"SSH is a service that allows logging into this computer remotely via "
"dedicated\n"
"SSH client</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ໄຟວໍ ແລະ SSH</big></b><br>\n"
"ໄຟວໍແມ່ນກົນໄກປ້ອງກັນທີ່ຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານຈາກການໂຈມຕີຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ.\n"
"SSH ແມ່ນບໍລິການທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຄອມພິວເຕີເຄື່ອງນີ້ຈາກທາງໄກ ຜ່ານ\n"
"ໂປຣແກຣມ SSH</p>"

#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/proposal.rb:104
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can choose whether the firewall will be enabled or disabled "
"after\n"
"the installation. It is recommended to keep it enabled.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານໄຟວໍ ຫຼັງຈາກ\n"
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້.</p>"

#. Enable sshd service checkbox
#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/proposal.rb:125
msgid "Enable SSH Service"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ SSH"

#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/proposal.rb:137
msgid ""
"<p>With enabled firewall, you can decide whether to open firewall port for "
"SSH\n"
" service and allow remote SSH logins. Independently you can also enable SSH "
"service (i.e. it\n"
"will be started on computer boot).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໄຟວໍແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະເປີດພອດໄຟວໍສຳລັບ\n"
"ບໍລິການ SSH ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ SSH ຈາກທາງໄກຫຼືບໍ່. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ "
"SSH ໄດ້ (ເຊິ່ງ\n"
"ມັນຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອເປີດເຄື່ອງຄອມພິວເຕີ).</p>"

#. Open ssh port checkbox
#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/proposal.rb:160
msgid "Open SSH Port"
msgstr "ເປີດພອດ SSH"

#. Open vnc port checkbox
#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/proposal.rb:187
msgid "Open &VNC Ports"
msgstr "ເປີດພອດ &VNC"

#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/proposal.rb:199
msgid ""
"<p>You can also open VNC ports in firewall. It will not enable\n"
"the remote administration service on a running system but it is\n"
"started by the installer automatically if needed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດພອດ VNC ໃນໄຟວໍໄດ້. ມັນຈະບໍ່ເປັນການເປີດໃຊ້\n"
"ບໍລິການຄວບຄຸມຈາກທາງໄກໃນລະບົບທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແຕ່ມັນຈະ\n"
"ຖືກເລີ່ມໂດຍຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າຈຳເປັນ.</p>"

#: src/lib/y2firewall/widgets/zone.rb:48
